    "terrainMinimap": "If no map-rendering implementation exists, render a compact schematic from application terrain data or a labeled placeholder. Do not fabricate an actual terrain image.",
    "orientation": "Apply per-screen mirror and rotation settings exactly once. Verify texture orientation against Blender UVs before introducing corrective flips.",
    "materialAssignment": "Use the intended screen surface material; do not replace unrelated module materials.",
    "textureUpdates": "Reuse CanvasTexture or equivalent resources where practical. Set texture.needsUpdate only when content changes.",
    "interaction": "Screens are informational unless an existing application interaction explicitly enables controls.",
    "errors": "A failed screen must not stop other screens from rendering."
  },
